// among_us — Crew ejection vote. AbilityId 3 (alphabetical: Kill,
// Task, Vote). Cast every 50 ticks ("vote phase") by every alive
// Crew. The verb's score function picks the agent with the highest
// `beliefs_suspicion(self, target)` from the cross-pair belief grid
// (Crew updates this when they witness an Imposter Kill, see
// among_us.sim::ApplyWitness consumer).
//
// `plant_belief 0 0` lowers to EffectOp::PlantBelief (kind=32) →
// EffectPlantBeliefApplied (kind=63). The consumer
// ApplyVoteFromChronicle bumps a per-target vote-tally counter
// (re-purposed mana SoA column on the target). At the end of the vote
// phase, the agent with the highest tally is ejected.

ability Vote {
    target: enemy
    range: 100.0
    cooldown: 1
    hint: utility

    plant_belief 0 bit 0 [UTILITY: 100]
}
